        <div class="mc-opts">
<span class="opt">A. 百萬位，3,000,000</span>
<span class="opt">B. 十萬位，300,000</span>
<span class="opt">C. 萬位，30,000</span>
<span class="opt">D. 千位，3,000</span>
</div>
</td>
<td class="qs"><span class="score-box">___ / 2分</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">3</td>
<td>
