<div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:4px;">▲ 三角形：底16cm·高9cm</div>
<div style="display:inline-block;max-width:280px;"><svg height="155" viewbox="0 0 190 155" width="190" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="35,105 155,105 35,20" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><polyline fill="none" points="43,10 43,18 35,18" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polyline><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="35" x2="35" y1="20" y2="105"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="21" y="63">h</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="14" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="95" y="127">b</text></svg></div>
</div>
三角形底長 16 cm，高 9 cm。面積 = ？
        <div class="mc-opts">
<span class="opt">A. 144 cm²</span>
<span class="opt">B. 72 cm²</span>
<span class="opt">C. 48 cm²</span>
<span class="opt">D. 25 cm²</span>
</div>
</td>
<td class="qs"><span class="score-box">___ / 2分</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">5</td>
<td>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;padding:6px;background:#FAFBFC;border:1px solid var(--borderc);border-radius:4px;">
<div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:4px;">▲ 梯形：斜邊11cm（陷阱！求面積不需要斜邊）</div>
<div style="display:inline-block;max-width:280px;"><svg height="130" viewbox="0 0 190 130" width="190" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="35,90 155,90 123,20 67,20" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="67" x2="67" y1="20" y2="90"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="79" y="55">h</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="95" y="112">b₂</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="94" y="12">b₁</text></svg></div>
</div>
梯形：上底 7 cm，下底 13 cm，斜邊 11 cm，高 6 cm。求面積時，下列哪項數字<strong>不需要</strong>使用？
        <div class="mc-opts">
<span class="opt">A. 7 cm</span>
<span class="opt">B. 13 cm</span>
<span class="opt">C. 11 cm</span>
<span class="opt">D. 6 cm</span>
</div>
</td>
<td class="qs"><span class="score-box">___ / 2分</span></td>
</tr>
