<span class="opt">C. 7</span>
<span class="opt">D. −3</span>
</div>
</td>
<td class="qs"><span class="score-box">___ / 2分</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">10</td>
<td>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;padding:6px;background:#FAFBFC;border:1px solid var(--borderc);border-radius:4px;">
<div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:4px;">▲ 平行四邊形：底2m·高80cm（陷阱！單位不一致）</div>
<div style="display:inline-block;max-width:280px;"><svg height="150" viewbox="0 0 180 150" width="180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="35,100 145,100 90,20" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="90" x2="90" y1="20" y2="100"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="102" y="60">h</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="14" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="90" y="122">b</text></svg></div>
